        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>关于北京打卡攻略</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #f9b8cd;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 22px 20px 26px 20px;\n    background: #f9b8cd;\n  }\n  .title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 42px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    margin: 8px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .title .red { color: #e8112d; }\n  .title .black { color: #111; }\n  .divider {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 3px solid #ffffff;\n    margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n  }\n  .section-head {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin: 18px 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  .check {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    background: #17c964;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 22px;\n    text-align: center;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .section-head h2 {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 23px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .item {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    margin: 2px 0;\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n  .num {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 19px;\n    height: 19px;\n    background: #2f6fed;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 19px;\n    text-align: center;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    vertical-align: 2px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .bold { font-weight: 800; }\n  .star {\n    color: #f5a524;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title\"><span class=\"red\">关于北京</span><span class=\"black\">打卡攻略</span></div>\n  <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\n    <span class=\"check\">&#10004;</span>\n    <h2>怎么到北京</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"bold\">北京机场：</span>首都国际机场/大兴国际机场，其中首都国际机场离市区比较近，机场都有公交/地铁/大巴到市区</div>\n  <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"bold\">首都国际机场：</span>距离市区约20km，地铁机场线可直达</div>\n  <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"bold\">大兴国际机场：</span>离市区约47km，地铁机场线可以直达</div>\n  <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"bold\">火车站：</span>有5个火车站，其中北京南站、北京站、北京西站是高铁站，建议选高铁</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\n    <span class=\"check\">&#10004;</span>\n    <h2>北京市内交通</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"num\">1</span>北京乘车码：可下载或者ZFB搜索【北京一卡通】和【亿通行】乘坐公交地铁，均可扫码支付，乘车有优惠。</div>\n  <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"num\">2</span>公交：部分公交线路，以分段式收费，上下车都要扫码；公交卡1元，ZFB可能有有优惠；投币2元</div>\n  <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"num\">3</span>地铁：3元起步价按里程收费，最高7元，5点-23点有车</div>\n  <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"num\">4</span>打车：出租车3公里内起步价14元，超出2.3元/公里，夜间加20% 网约车建议到商圈/车站500米外再定位叫车</div>\n  <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"num\">5</span>汽车：北京的汽车站超级多，离北京近的可以坐汽车，远的就不推荐了，另外晕车的小伙伴记得备好晕车药</div>\n  <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"num\">6</span>共享电动车：10公里内建议，车多人多注意安全，但是天安门广场附近的区域是不让进的</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\n    <span class=\"check\">&#10004;</span>\n    <h2>北京6-8月天气</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"star\">&#9733;</span>6月平均温度是21℃ ~ 32℃</div>\n  <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"star\">&#9733;</span>7月平均温度是23℃ ~ 32℃</div>\n  <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"star\">&#9733;</span>8月平均温度是21℃ ~ 32℃</div>\n  <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"star\">&#9733;</span>建议穿搭：穿棉麻面料的衬衫、薄长裙、薄T恤，早晚有温差，带上套装、夹衣、风衣、休闲装、夹克衫、西装、薄毛衣等衣服</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
